{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20266OVvW8T2l91794404819.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關在上水和深水埗，合共搗破三個私煙儲存倉，檢獲59萬支私煙，拘捕三人。</p><p></p><p>被捕包括兩名內地男子及一名本地女子。其中兩人被黑布蒙頭，鎖上手銬，由海關帶走調查。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CIGARETTE-1730_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026L3wubAS5il1794404830.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海關周二在上水巡撫街，截查一名可疑男子，調查後在附近一間地舖和一個唐樓單位，搜出49萬支私煙。期間發現另一名涉案男子將兩人拘捕。</p><p></p><p>另外，海關今日於深水埗欽州街，截查一名可疑女子在其手袋和唐樓劏房單位，搜出約十萬支私煙。兩次行動共搜獲59萬支私煙，市值265萬港元，應課稅值195萬港元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:21.071561+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T12:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:57:12.660490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:12:44.444038+00:00","content_hash":"ced3d2f13c88385aef9e6db40171fec18b0fc496f5fc207701f04ddf5ef53fb3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:19:21.071561+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}